<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine cash Jan wheat weaker in good volume.</title>
<headline>Argentine cash Jan wheat weaker in good volume.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine January cash wheat prices on Buenos Aires Cereals exchange were weaker on a strong offer in good volume trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>Cash maize prices were steady to slightly weaker.</p>
<p>Soybean and sunflower prices were firm on interest from crushers amid strong international demand.</p>
<p>--Buenos Aires Newsroom, +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
